sumer court.", "link": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ZNVNFNDRjMVZLUm1OMFNUbFVkMWRUYW5BMVFWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x89c033502335359f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnY5SE44c1VKRmN0STlUd1dTanA1QVE%7C%7C?hl=en-US", "date": "2 months ago", "date_iso8601": "2026-07-27T07:43:24+00:00"}, {"username": "Manish Sinha", "rating": 1, "contributor_id": "117815535222609543088", "user_review_count": 10, "user_photo_count": 1, "user_thumbnail": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJBx9w6ktsWFOpeZ6MERvn3TnZ2TIn1OIc9Y8S6LMzztjvuGqyD=s120-c-rp-mo-br100", "description": "My horrifying experience with Razorpay!\nAccount suspended for “malicious activity” without reason. Created ticket on their own. I am clueless. There is no way that you can reach to them. The link to dashboard led me to login page. When tried to login it rflected a message \"there is no account linked to this mail ID. Asked me to open new account. I registered with the same email ID, the portal said it requires manual verification for ehich I had to pay Rs.199/-. Post that the account displayed that this could not be activated as it's linked to another account.\nQuestion is if the account was deleted how come it's linked to an existing account.\nNo support email, chatbot useless, zero help since 2nd Oct'25. Poor customer service & no accountability. They do not publlish helpline number. Chatbot is ill trained. No contact email id.\nI have beenj revceiving calls and they keep asking and keep telling me \"they are escalating to relevant team, but it seems that the revant tea is non existant or it's toooooo Busy.\nSwitched to Phone Pe Business — far better support & clarity.\n#Razorpay #CustomerExperience #BusinessGrowth #EntrepreneurLife #PhonePe #CustomerSupport #StartupIndia #RBI", "link": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGelJWWk1iMTlRTFZCd2VYTnBUbWh3VDJkaFgyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x89c033502335359f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkFzRVZMb19QLVBweXNpTmhwT2dhX2c%7C%7C?hl=en-US", "date": "11 months ago", "date_iso8601": "2025-10-24T08:29:52+00:00"}, {"username": "Arpita Sam", "rating": 1, "contributor_id": "106344945816775778867", "user_review_count": 23, "user_photo_count": 72, "user_thumbnail": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW8qsa2Ei3fFs-Bn_HmVl8IUVfqAmkmce3vf5xpstd8y2HXkoeB=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100", "description": "I do not recommend using Razorpay as payment gateway. When there is an issue with payment they don't help you make make false statement, unnecessary waste your time.\n\nI  am writing this to alert the public about a highly unprofessional experience regarding a cancelled order with the merchant Shobo, processed via Razorpay.\nThe Issue:\nFalse Claims: The merchant stated a refund of ₹3,850 was processed, which never arrived.\nSupport Failure: Razorpay customer care deflected responsibility, advising me to file a formal bank chargeback.\nDeceptive Resolution: During the bank's investigation, the chargeback was rejected because the Razorpay team provided false confirmation that the dispute was settled and the amount has been refunded.\nThe Bottom Line:I have provided exhaustive evidence and bank statements proving zero funds were received. In contrast, neither Shobo nor Razorpay can provide a valid transaction receipt or Acquirer Reference Number (ARN). It is deeply concerning that platforms operating at this scale resort to such deceptive tactics over a minor amount. Proceed with extreme caution while making payment with Razorpay", "link": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214YVFYWkZUWEZZYnpacE5qRm9ZbkF6VG01emJrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x89c033502335359f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmxaQXZFTXFYbzZpNjFoYnAzTm5zbkE%7C%7C?hl=en-US", "date": "3 months ago", "date_iso8601": "2026-07-05T09:55:13+00:00"}, {"username": "Prashanth Rao", "rating": 1, "contributor_id": "113716461682311017381", "user_review_count": 3, "user_photo_count": 0, "user_thumbnail": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJb0lC9sZmRl7VRsKzym6TAOhMgAskO3QLbH9Naq6I8bxpc3g=s120-c-rp-mo-br100", "description": "Worst customer service I've experienced from a payment gateway provider.\n\nI submitted a callback request to Razorpay three days ago to discuss custom pricing and instant settlement, but I still haven't received any response.\n\nIn comparison, Cashfree shared all the required information within an hour of my enquiry.\n\nReally disappointed with the lack of responsiveness and customer support from Razorpay.", "link": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGdFFsRXdOa0ZaWVZOUlNUQlliSEp5YVVsdmVWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x89c033502335359f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjFtQlEwNkFZYVNRSTBYbHJyaUlveVE%7C%7C?hl=en-US", "date": "3 months ago", "date_iso8601": "2026-07-07T06:07:55+00:00"}, {"username": "Anish Kumar", "rating": 5, "contributor_id": "108677236843207426002", "user_review_count": 2, "user_photo_count": 7, "user_thumbnail": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVw_7x-z2M5vqd82OQSZXSCMDZvSRVf9N4rcrqrW0YJ-BcB6i-N=s120-c-rp-mo-br100", "description": "Started my first business 8 months back and razorpay was recommended by my developer. Setup was done in 2 hours, KYC was not too much trouble. Pricing is transparent which i liked very much, 2% flat no other fees. My friend was using another gateway and got charged ₹5000 annual fee which i did not have to pay here. Customer care is okay but not always fast. Good and reliable product overall for new businesses.", "link": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GbmNGUlFWbEJHV21OaWNHZEJOelJXVmpkMGNWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x89c033502335359f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmFncFRQVlBGWmNicGdBNzRWVjd0cVE%7C%7C?hl=en-US", "date": "6 months ago", "date_iso8601": "2026-04-02T12:24:36+00:00"}, {"username": "Rajat Tiwari", "rating": 5, "contributor_id": "115790368325730076774", "user_review_count": 1, "user_photo_count": 0, "user_thumbnail": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ8DdcOjUC800Suo-enQj5r49fOw1D21EtInrbUEnnsElc0jA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100", "description": "Was on a diffrent gateway for 7 months thinking i was saving money at 1.75% TDR. Did a proper annual cost review and realised their ₹5000 AMC had quietly wiped out every rupee id saved on fees. Moved to razorpay, zero AMC, zero setup, 2% flat. At my volume it actually works out cheaper tbh. Payment success rates have also been noticeably better since switching. Support response time can be abit slow sometimes thats my only real complaint. But on pure economics for a early stage brand this is the right call.", "link": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25oUVVUbGtjemxHV0ZWb1l6UkxjbU5oVnpoTlNYYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x89c033502335359f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnhQUTlkczlGWFVoYzRLcmNhVzhNSXc%7C%7C?hl=en-US", "date": "6 months ago", "date_iso8601": "2026-03-31T07:14:25+00:00"}, {"username": "Shivansh Kaushik", "rating": 5, "contributor_id": "107459799001621784545", "user_review_count": 1, "user_photo_count": 0, "user_thumbnail": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKLfm3ERYEJFW1cskQwfpSvPQ-OfHj0gLKrKviezaAv5wyY1w=s120-c-rp-mo-br100", "description": "Using razorpay for more than one year now. Thing is people are only looking at TDR percentage but not doing full calculation. At my monthly volume i compared 2% against competitors at 1.7 to 1.8%. Once you add their annual maintanance charges razorpay is coming out same cost or cheaper itself. And payment success rate is consistently good (for me it was consistent 93% + which is insane) which is more important than fee percentage only. Dashboard is little complicated with so many products now but payment processing is solid.", "link": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OaVFrSm9XalF5WlZjdE1FRnhkVVZvWTNoVlgyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x89c033502335359f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmNiQkJoWjQyZVctMEFxdUVoY3hVX2c%7C%7C?hl=en-US", "date": "6 months ago", "date_iso8601": "2026-03-31T09:30:04+00:00"}, {"username": "Komal Sehrawat", "rating": 4, "contributor_id": "101501745616908414091", "user_review_count": 1, "user_photo_count": 0, "user_thumbnail": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL6UHnQIjZ5Vlno3t5-e6bUbtKXCpsr4lsIV6f_CoMdJHUYwA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100", "description": "Used Razorpay to launch my first product. Onboarding was smooth and the pricing was the most transparent I found, 2% flat, nothing else. Had looked at Cashfree and Easebuzz before deciding, both had annual maintenance charges that pushed the actual cost higher than Razorpay's at my transaction volume. Four stars instead of five because custom pricing negotiation is applicabl after 5L GMV, which might be acceptable. But for anyone starting out zero fixed cost is very important na, would still recommend.", "link": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xsUlRUTXlXRFJVYjFsRUxVMWhSblpUY0ZWWWNVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x89c033502335359f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOllRTTMyWDRUb1lELU1hRnZTcFVYcUE%7C%7C?hl=en-US", "date": "6 months ago", "date_iso8601": "2026-03-31T09:25:17+00:00"}]}, "people_also_search_for": [{"search_term": "People also search for", "local_results": [{"position": 1, "title": "Razorpay (Arena Office)", "data_id": "0x0:0x822cd424898295d9", "data_cid": "9380105377296848345", "reviews_link": "https://serpapi.com/search.json?data_id=0x0%3A0x822cd424898295d9&engine=google_maps_reviews&hl=en", "photos_link": "https://serpapi.com/search.json?data_id=0x0%3A0x822cd424898295d9&engine=google_maps_photos&hl=en", "gps_coordinates": {"latitude": 12.9372847, "longitude": 77.6099462}, "place_id_search": "https://serpapi.com/search.json?data=%214m5%213m4%211s0x0%3A0x822cd424898295d9%218m2%213d12.9372847%214d77.6099462&engine=google_maps&google_domain=google.com&hl=en&type=place", "rating": 4, "reviews": 67, "thumbnail": "https://lh3.goog